{"unit_id":"Huauauaa__dsh-notify#card-zh","repo":"Huauauaa/dsh-notify","commit":"8fe5247b939b378fc30a44993838c9355a9d27f8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"HTTP 通知（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：把根 agent 的完成、错误、提问和审批事件发送到自定义 HTTP webhook。插件轮询 agent 阶段并监听会话事件；设置页可填写 webhook 地址、方法、请求头、接收方和认证字段。支持全局默认及单会话开关，也可手动发送连通性测试。适合希望通过自有 HTTP 接口接收 DSH 进度提醒的用户，使用前需配置 webhook 地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:80-138","index.js:185-219","client.js:69-127","client.js:210-269","notify.js:85-101"]}
{"unit_id":"Huauauaa__dsh-notify#card-en","repo":"Huauauaa/dsh-notify","commit":"8fe5247b939b378fc30a44993838c9355a9d27f8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"HTTP Notification sends DSH completion, error, question, and approval alerts to a custom webhook. The Web plugin polls agent phases, listens for session events, and provides global and per-session switches plus a test action. Configure the URL, method, headers, receiver, and auth in settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:80-138","index.js:185-219","client.js:69-127","client.js:210-269","notify.js:85-101"]}
